OL,3,GNEWSARepairs start on historic market
OL,4,Across after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has begun to remove the remains of
OL,7,Fa historic town centre Market Cross
OL,8,Fafter it was demolished when a 4x4
OL,9,Fcrashed into it last month.
OL,11,FThe incident, in Howden's Market Place,
OL,12,Fleft the Range Rover straddling the
OL,13,Fstructure's base and sections of the
OL,14,Fcross strewn across the ground.
OL,16,FThe loose pieces of masonry from the
OL,17,Fcross, which was carved in 1909, and
OL,18,Fpart of the base, which dates back to
OL,19,Fthe medieval period, have been taken
OL,20,Faway for repair by a stonemason.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
