OL,3,GNEWSARepairs start on historic market
OL,4,Across after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,7,Fit will be "stored securely off site"
OL,8,Fand "any repair will not take place
OL,9,Funtil Spring." They added this is "the
OL,10,Ffirst step in determining its future."
